  <ImageTitle>
    Such Happy Joy ^w^
  </ImageTitle>
  <Author>
    Niji System (Satoki Nijikawa, Wamo, Kiyoi, Vihreääketty, Hsiao Lyuhsien, Antiainehunt Õudus)
  </Author>
  <Date>
    2025/07/02
  </Date>
  <ImageType>
    Portable Network Graphics (PNG) file
  </ImageType>
  <AltText>
    A PC-98-esque bust of Joy_Wonders' OC, Joy. She has bright pink hair with blue and yellow highlights. Her eyes are purple and faded purple. She is wearing a choker with her moon charm and is also wearing a bright green shirt that has slid off the left shoulder. She has black cat ears.
  </AltText>
  <Description>
    Drew this one in dotpict instead of Krita. Drawing with our phone's stylus still feels very different from using our tablet's pen. Tried going for a more PC-98 esque style!
    Also challenged myself with this one, only allowing myself one, yes [i][b]one[/b][/i], layer.
    Still was very fun drawing Joy. Such a happy bean!
    Also wrote her name in katakana (ジョイ) :3
    P.S. And kept myself under 16 colours!
  </Description>
